# This project tracks the latest graphify release and deliberately does NOT pin
# graphify in requirements.txt or anywhere else. Pinning caused silent drift:
# this file sat at 0.9.46 while 0.9.67 was current, and no code read the file to
# notice.
#
# graphify ships its own copy of this skill and installs it per platform, so
# after upgrading the CLI run:
#
#     uv tool upgrade graphifyy
#     graphify install --platform hermes
#
# and then copy the refreshed skill over this directory so the repo tracks the
# installed version. `scripts/init_graphify.py` reports the installed version and
# warns when the skill and the CLI disagree.
